# Title: User Discovery And Export Via Get-ADUser Cmdlet
# ID: 1114e048-b69c-4f41-bc20-657245ae6e3f
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-09
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1033
# Description: Detects usage of the Get-ADUser cmdlet to collect user information and output it to a file
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:*Get-ADUser * AND cmdline:* -Filter \\**) AND (cmdline:* > * OR cmdline:* | Select * OR cmdline:*Out-File* OR cmdline:*Set-Content* OR cmdline:*Add-Content*)) AND (((process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((OriginalFileName:"PowerShell.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"pwsh.dll"))))
